{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026drczguuDHE1793069716.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有市場人士指觀望聯儲局議息結果，港股走勢短線仍有風險。</p><p></p><p>富昌金融集團聯席董事譚朗蔚表示︰「雖然本周是美國聯儲局議息，但大家也看到利率期貨反映美國應不會加息。恒生指數為例，只是一個半月以來的下跌反彈而已，當然也不用特別『估底』，所以現在這一刻仍有些風險需要關注。大概23,500點，企穩就是有改善；24,000點左右，再企穩就是脫險。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:02:23.194543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:58:45.568759+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:58:45.568759+00:00","content_hash":"469fdf8e93637596359a1c14933a20ef0a5355caf70ebc7a1f80b7e73a2f76ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}